dfd60fb_96.png","avatar_url_64":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_64.png","avatar_url_48":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_48.png","avatar_url_40":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_40.png","avatar_url_30":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_30.png","avatar_url_24":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_24.png","avatar_url_16":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/avatar_5c00fdfd60fb_16.png"},"photo-caption":"<p>SoftFaktor is a solution created for financial institutions that offer factoring services.<\/p>\n<p>The System consists of two integrated modules: the Back-Office module for employees to carry out accounting and billing tasks and the Front-Office Portal for final clients.<\/p>\n<p>SoftFaktor system ensures a full support regarding factoring processes and services from creating a client file, agreement and documentation to factoring limit activation and invoice issuing. The System calculates fees and commissions automatically, create transfers, and settles the available factoring balance.<\/p>\n<p>SoftFaktor can be used to operate the debt and non-recourse factoring in different currency and various product types.<\/p>","width":1916,"height":837,"photo-url-1280":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_1280.png","photo-url-500":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_500.png","photo-url-400":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_400.png","photo-url-250":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_250.png","photo-url-100":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_100.png","photo-url-75":"https:\/\/64.media.tumblr.com\/43c82f56e7df5762f77571a29a957708\/tumblr_prn73jMORA1rpfcyyo1_75sq.png","photos":[],"tags":["wicket-8","submission